# ... and the ADMIN's, which the Gatsby `public` rule above had been eating
# since the day it was written. `web/config-app/public/sw.js` is the push
# service worker: never committed, so never in the build context, so never in
# the image, so /admin/sw.js answered 404 on the live board and desktop
# notifications could not be switched on by anybody.
!web/config-app/public/
!web/config-app/public/**
