# Lowercase, and AmiExpress's own rename artifacts. `Node*/Answers` matched
# the tidy name and nothing else, so `Node2/answers` and a 183 KB
# `Node2/.!99887!answers` - 52 caller e-mail addresses - were committed by the
# bulk "restore Node0-40 for the Docker build" pass and sat in a PUBLIC repo.
# git's ignore matching is case-sensitive; the board's filesystem is not.
board/Node*/answers
board/Node*/ANSWERS
board/Node*/.!*
