# GMaster audio lives ON THE SERVER, not in git: 29 MB of MP3 (18 tracks,
# 83 effects, 10 voice clips) for one door is not worth carrying in a
# repository, and that is the sysop's call.
#
# It is on the live volume at
#   /app/data/bbs/Doors/grandmaster/assets/{music,sounds,voices}
# and it SURVIVES deploys: the entrypoint syncs Doors/ with `cp -r src/. dst/`,
# which is additive, and only the explicit ORPHANS list is ever deleted.
#
# To restore it on a fresh server, from a checkout that has the files:
#   cd Doors/grandmaster/assets && tar czf /tmp/a.tgz music sounds voices
#   scp /tmp/a.tgz root@<host>:/tmp/
#   docker cp /tmp/a.tgz amiexpress-bbs:/tmp/
#   docker exec amiexpress-bbs sh -c \
#     'cd /app/data/bbs/Doors/grandmaster/assets && tar xzf /tmp/a.tgz'
#
# Without it every sound and track in that door 404s, which is what it did
# from 2026-01-12 until 2026-08-31.
board/Doors/grandmaster/assets/music/
board/Doors/grandmaster/assets/sounds/
board/Doors/grandmaster/assets/voices/

