# BBC Micro: the sysop's ROMs and software, never the repository's.
#
# Acorn never permitted redistribution of the BBC OS, BASIC or DFS ROMs -
# they asked archives to take them down - and the disc images are whatever
# the board's owner has the right to run. The board loads both from here at
# runtime; nothing in this folder but the documentation is ours to ship.
board/Beeb/roms/**
board/Beeb/software/**
!board/Beeb/roms/.gitkeep
!board/Beeb/roms/b/.gitkeep
!board/Beeb/software/.gitkeep

